{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫劇《璀璨之城》昨晚（28日）一集高潮迭起，亮點處處，包括連日來在網絡引爆熱話的方易安（鄭子誠飾），以飾演奸角馳名的鄭子誠，這次在《璀璨》收起情緒，飾演處變不驚、深藏不露、隨時可以轉換立場，以便立於不敗之地的老練管家！</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:58:19.869324+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:13:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T23:18:08.010553+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:58:19.869324+00:00","content_hash":"f743fb319b4af3137362560f88799398e6a90acc7fdffb2af363b90f94950492","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}